    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rama's Quest</strong> is an action survival game where you equip unique weapons and get divine powers from the gods to help you face endless demons in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become Rama, the legendary archer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your bow against challenging swarms of demons that haunt the Dandaka Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/6b4173e143867fce41bc95803bded0e4.poster.avif?t=1728936231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/6b4173e143867fce41bc95803bded0e4.webm?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/6b4173e143867fce41bc95803bded0e4.mp4?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invoke Divine Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Vishnu, Arjuna, Krishna, and more legendary gods from Hindu mythology. Perfect your builds by invoking their boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/83ee7c24f0dcdaae64391705eae6cdaf.poster.avif?t=1728936231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/83ee7c24f0dcdaae64391705eae6cdaf.webm?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/83ee7c24f0dcdaae64391705eae6cdaf.mp4?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight unique enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest contains Rakshasa with various attack styles, like sword slashing, ground slamming, spear throwing, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b8f8817fa6a7b4bde6b273c865d2a1d5.poster.avif?t=1728936231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b8f8817fa6a7b4bde6b273c865d2a1d5.webm?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b8f8817fa6a7b4bde6b273c865d2a1d5.mp4?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Powerful Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through powerful Rakshasa bosses to win</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b0846ea598bcf84bf0c834312359bf76.poster.avif?t=1728936231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b0846ea598bcf84bf0c834312359bf76.webm?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786990/extras/b0846ea598bcf84bf0c834312359bf76.mp4?t=1728936231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to keep up with updates and new releases from Roadtrip Games.</p>",
